<title>USA: Copley says Warner-Lambert suit dismissed.</title>
<headline>Copley says Warner-Lambert suit dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Copley Pharmaceutical Inc said Tuesday that a lawsuit brought by Warner-Lambert Co against the company has been dismissed.</p>
<p>Under the settlement agreement, Warner-Lambert's action was dismissed with prejudice and all parties will bear their own costs.</p>
<p>In January, Warner-Lambert said it filed a lawsuit alleging that Copley induced a former Warner-Lambert employee to reveal information about one of its drugs.</p>
</text>
